  "description": "<p data-end=\"448\" data-start=\"139\"><strong data-end=\"162\" data-start=\"139\">Brand Introduction:</strong><br data-end=\"165\" data-start=\"162\">MAE Swimwear is a premium Australian brand dedicated to creating stylish, functional, and sun-safe swimsuits for little girls. Designed by a mom, our swimsuits are thoughtfully crafted to solve real-world parenting challenges&mdash;while keeping kids comfortable, confident, and protected.</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"453\" data-start=\"450\">\r\n<p data-end=\"904\" data-start=\"455\"><strong data-end=\"479\" data-start=\"455\">Product Description:</strong><br data-end=\"482\" data-start=\"479\">Each MAE swimsuit features our <strong data-end=\"553\" data-start=\"513\">innovative, patented bathroom zipper</strong>, making trips to the restroom quicker and more hygienic&mdash;no need to remove the entire suit. We pair this game-changing feature with <strong data-end=\"711\" data-start=\"685\">UPF 50+ sun protection</strong>, an <strong data-end=\"741\" data-start=\"716\">easy-fit front zipper</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"777\" data-start=\"747\">gorgeous, exclusive prints</strong> kids love. Made with premium, durable materials, MAE Swimwear combines performance and style for families who live in the sun.</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"909\" data-start=\"906\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1350\" data-start=\"911\"><strong data-end=\"942\" data-start=\"911\">USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong><br data-end=\"945\" data-start=\"942\">MAE Swimwear holds an <strong data-end=\"1018\" data-start=\"967\">exclusive patent for the bathroom zipper design</strong> in nearly 40 countries&mdash;including <strong data-end=\"1145\" data-start=\"1052\">Australia, New Zealand, the United States, United Kingdom, Canada, and the European Union</strong>. This makes MAE the <strong data-end=\"1189\" data-start=\"1166\">only brand globally</strong> offering this practical, parent-approved solution. Combined with sun protection, comfort, and fashion-forward prints, MAE sets a new standard in kids&rsquo; swimwear.</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1355\" data-start=\"1352\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1551\" data-start=\"1357\"><strong data-end=\"1375\" data-start=\"1357\">Payment Terms:</strong><br data-end=\"1378\" data-start=\"1375\">Affiliates earn 10% on every sale, with a 30-day tracking cookie. Payouts are made monthly via PayPal or bank transfer.</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1556\" data-start=\"1553\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1582\" data-start=\"1558\"><strong data-end=\"1580\" data-start=\"1558\">Other Information:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1921\" data-start=\"1583\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1615\" data-start=\"1583\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1615\" data-start=\"1585\">Worldwide shipping available</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1671\" data-start=\"1616\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1671\" data-start=\"1618\">High customer satisfaction and repeat purchase rate</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1734\" data-start=\"1672\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1734\" data-start=\"1674\">Fresh styles and limited-edition prints released regularly</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1804\" data-start=\"1735\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1804\" data-start=\"1737\">Marketing assets provided (banners, product images, copy support)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1921\" data-start=\"1805\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1921\" data-start=\"1807\">Perfect fit for influencers and content creators in parenting, lifestyle, kids&rsquo; fashion, and summer/outdoor spaces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
